    <briefdescription>
<para>OpenGL Index Buffer Object (EBO/IBO) wrapper. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An index buffer stores vertex indices for indexed drawing (glDrawElements). This allows reusing vertices and reduces memory usage.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The buffer is created with GL_STATIC_DRAW usage. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classVertexBuffer" kindref="compound">VertexBuffer</ref>, <ref refid="classVertexArray" kindref="compound">VertexArray</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
